id: pm-gis0qo
title: Same-day ordinal npm publish requires an explicit stable dist-tag
description: "The release workflow accepts calendar follow-up versions such as 2026.7.24-2, but npm 11 refuses to publish any hyphenated semver without --tag. Select the stable dist-tag explicitly for every supported calendar version, prove the workflow contract, and recover the failed same-day release without manual npm publication."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: "area:ci","area:release",npm,regression
created_at: "2026-07-24T08:16:03.790Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-26T17:14:35.363Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-24T09:04:40.278Z"
author: claude-code-agent
parent: pm-u9d0
release: v2026.7.24-3
severity: high
repro_steps: Push supported tag v2026.7.24-2 and inspect Release run 30077790348 Publish to npm.
resolution: Fixed by explicit stable npm dist-tag publication and an every-publish workflow contract.
expected_result: Tag-triggered Release publishes supported same-day ordinal versions and updates the stable npm channel.
actual_result: "npm publish exits 1: You must specify a tag using --tag when publishing a prerelease version."
affected_version: 2026.7.24-2
fixed_version: 2026.7.24-3
